# Training.md Source Summary

This source introduces "Training" as a universal mental model for navigating complex situations. It provides a conceptual framework for making sense of patterns and relationships in the world, drawing on David Epstein's research from *The Sports Gene: Inside the Science of Extraordinary Athletic Performance*. The model is applicable across all domains with moderate confidence (0.7), reflecting thin evidentiary support from a single source.
